OL,3,GNEWSAUnder-fire ambulance service
OL,4,Aimproves in ratings
OL,5,
OL,6,FInspectors who visited an ambulance
OL,7,Fservice formerly rated as the worst in
OL,8,Fthe country have now rated several
OL,9,Fparts of the service as good.
OL,11,FSouth Western Ambulance Service Trust's
OL,12,F(SWAST) emergency and urgent care,
OL,13,Femergency operations, resilience,
OL,14,Furgent care and patient transport
OL,15,Fservices were inspected by the Care
OL,16,FQuality Commission (CQC) between April
OL,17,Fand July.
OL,19,FCatherine Campbell, from the CQC, said:
OL,20,F"We found people were receiving safe
OL,21,Fand effective care across the board."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
